corr('P001323','Gaussian surface integral','Integrate all vertex positions without fixing translation','Pin one vertex or divide by translation volume before taking determinant powers.','Every edge energy is translation invariant; the constant graph-Laplacian mode has zero eigenvalue.')
corr('P001324','Planar limit Eq. (11)','Z=lim log I_N','Z=lim N^(-2) log[I_N(g)/I_N(0)], as a formal normalized series.','Compare BIPZ (1978) and the N squared power of connected planar vacuum graphs.')
corr('P001325','Three-matrix angular Eq. (14)','Three independent angular matrices; final spectral factor mu','Impose U12 U23 U31=I, integrate only two independent relative matrices, and use lambda in the third pair.','Both source transcriptions identify final mu; Daul (1995), Sec. 1 explicitly explains the nonindependence of cyclic relative angles.')
